{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 3099, humanity\u2019s most intimate frontier is under attack. Mutant bacteria infest delicate areas, and only one machine stands between order and chaos: the Vaginator 3000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not a doctor, but you operate the Vaginator 3000, a tool designed to eliminate mutant bacterias in clients with... specialized needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900290/extras/0ea79c48e53b92931d9e4e1be32bb8a2.avif?t=1755270858\" width=1600 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level places you in a sci-fi medical chamber with a client. Your mission is to find and eliminate bacteria by precise clicking. The gameplay emphasizes speed, accuracy, and visual detail across static scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 60+ levels, all presented with stylish cyberpunk illustrations.<br>Simple point-and-click gameplay<br>Unlockable gallery with all collected images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of immersive visuals and focused arcade gameplay that delivers a bold adult experience. Designed for players seeking a provocative and engaging challenge, the Vaginator 3000 invites you to dive into a futuristic world where precision and discretion are key.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3900290/47ad5552f01f3b1fb6a17d48d14bc1800a5817fa.jpg"},{"name":"Bacteria Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3900290/08a2851803eaa225b16f37383c4894119532b289.jpg"},{"name":"Bacteria Extermina